                <pb facs="0440" n="342" sameAs="frus:frus1930v02/pg342"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.05/276: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of
                            State to the Minister in China</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Johnson</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1930-03-12T10:00:00-05:00">March 12, 1930—10
                        a.m.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>90. Your 181, March 7, noon. Department approves, provided the Chinese
                    representatives are of correspondingly high position.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Cotton</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
